      "anchor": "lifts-geometric-trace-matrix-adjoint",
      "title": "Which matrix is adjoint for the alternating trace form?",
      "hypotheses": "The diagonal coefficients of H are nonzero and fixed by conjugation. The weight δ and the alternating trace pairing are those of the rank-n arithmetic datum.",
